    "kind": "text",
    "x": 12.5,
    "y": 4.19,
    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 1.442222222222222,
    "text": "A single global model enforces one input-to-moisture mapping across all stations. We divide observations into two environmental regimes and fit a dedicated XGBoost specialist to each. Each specialist predicts daily volumetric soil moisture at 5 cm depth (m\u00b3/m\u00b3).",
    "lines": [
